52</a><br></span></p><p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><br></p><p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">\u63d0\u9192\uff1a</span></p><p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">1.\u8acb\u4e8b\u524d\u5b8c\u6210\u8ab2\u7a0b\u524d\u5c0e\u6e2c\u9a57\u4ee5\u5229\u8ab2\u7a0b\u9032\u884c\uff1a<a class=\"\" href=\"https://forms.gle/Czk3hZzjYpxeJNB26\" style=\"color: rgb(61, 129, 219);\" target=\"_blank\">\u9023\u7d50LINK</a></span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">\u3002<br>Please complete the pre-course test\u00a0 before taking the course.</span></p><p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">\u53c3\u8207\u8ab2\u7a0b\u6642\u9700\u9032\u884c\u7c3d\u5230\u9000\uff01\u5be6\u9ad4\u8ab2\u7a0b\u7d50\u675f\u5f8c\uff0c\u7531\u8ab2\u7a0b\u7a2e\u5b50\u63d0\u4f9b\u8ab2\u7a0b\u5b78\u7fd2\u55ae\u9023\u7d50\uff0c\u8acb\u52d9\u5fc5\u586b\u5beb\u5594\u3002<br>You must sign in and out when participating in the course! After the physical course ends, the course facilitator will provide a link to the course learning sheet, please be sure to fill it out!</span></p><p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">3.\u8ab2\u7a0b\u6642\u6578\u8a8d\u5217\u8aaa\u660e\uff1a\u7d93\u6771\u6d77\u5927\u5b78\u6d3b\u52d5\u5831\u540d\u7cfb\u7d71\u6210\u529f\u5831\u540d\uff0c\u9700\u5b8c\u6210\u524d\u5c0e\u6e2c\u9a57\u5f8c\u51fa\u5e2d\u8ab2\u7a0b\u7c3d\u5230\u4e14\u5168\u7a0b\u53c3\u8207\u6d3b\u52d5\u5f8c\uff0c\u5b8c\u6210\u6d3b\u52d5\u5b78\u7fd2\u55ae\uff0c\u5373</span><span class=\"color-E33737\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">\u8a8d\u5217\u672c\u5b78\u671f\u751f\u6d3b\u6c38\u7e8c\u8ab2\u7a0b\u6642\u65781\u5c0f\u6642</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">\u3002<br>Course Hour Recognition Instructions: Upon successful registration through the Tunghai University event registration system, completion of the event pre-test, attendance at the course sign-in and full participation in the event, and completion of the event learning sheet, one hour of life Sustainability course time will be recognized for this semester.</span></p>","course":{"department":{"name":"\u901a\u8b58\u8ab2\u7a0b:\u6c38\u7e8c\u5be6\u8e10\u9818\u57df"},"grade":{"name":""},"id":165573,"klass":{"name":""},"name":"(1142_3502)\u6c38\u7e8c\u5be6\u8e10\uff1a\u52de\u4f5c\u6559\u80b2\uff08\u4e8c\uff09"},"created_at":"2026-05-17T08:36:07Z","created_by":{"id":0,"name":"[REDACTED_NAME]"},"deleted":0,"end_time":null,"id":373206,"imported_from":null,"imported_track_id":null,"send_email":true,"send_mail_count":1,"send_type":"default","start_time":null,"targets":["a0"],"targets_name":["\u6240\u6709\u4eba"],"title":"\u3010\u52de\u4f5c\u6559\u80b2\u751f\u6d3b\u6c38\u7e8c\u3011--\u751f\u6d3b\u7bc0\u80fd\u5be6\u9ad4\u8ab2\u7a0b-\u7b2c14\u9031(115/05/25--115/05/29)\u958b\u653e\u9810\u7d04","updated_at":null,"updated_by":{"id":0,"name":null},"uploads":[]},{"content":"<h1 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700; line-height: 45px; font-size: 26px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">\u672c\u5b78\u671f\u793e\u6703\u6c38\u7e8c \u3010<span class=\"color-E33737\">\u6771\u5927\u6eaa\u8d70\u8b80</span>\u3011\u5be6\u9ad4\u8ab2\u7a0b\u00a0 \u7b2c\u5341\u4e09\u9031<span class=\"color-E33737\">5/18-5/22</span>\u00a0 \u958b\u653e <span class=\"color-E33737\">5/17(\u65e5)PM5:00~5/18(\u4e00)PM5:00</span> <span class=\"color-E33737\">\u9810\u7d04</span></h1><h3 style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); line-height: 36px; font-size: 21px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700;\">\u6bcf\u5802\u958b\u653e\u5831\u540d\u4eba\u657816\u4eba\uff0c\u984d\u6eff\u70ba\u6b62</span></h3><p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"line-height: inherit; font-weight: 700;\">\u6eab\u99a8\u63d0\u9192\uff0c\u8acb\u52ff\u7ff9\u6389\u5176\u4ed6\u8ab2\u7a0b\u4f86\u53c3\u8207\u52de\u4f5c\u6559\u80b2\u6c38\u7e8c\u8ab2\u7a0b\u5594\uff01</span></p><hr style=\"border-top-color: rgb(204, 204, 204); border-right-color: initial; border-bottom-color: initial; border-left-color: initial; font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">1.\u672c\u6b21\u958b\u653e\u9031\u6b21\uff1a<span class=\"color-E33737\" style=\"font-size: 1.25em;\">\u7b2c13\u9031 5/18-5/22</span></p><p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">2.\u8ab2\u7a0b\u9810\u7d04\u767b\u8a18\u65b9\u5f0f\uff1a\u6821\u5712\u6d3b\u52d5\u5831\u540d\u7cfb\u7d71\uff0c5/17(\u65e5) PM5:00\u9ede\u958b\u653e\u767b\u8a18</p><ul style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><li><p style=\"line-height: 24px;\">WEEK 13\uff085/18-5/22<span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem; background-color: transparent;\">\uff09 </span><a class=\"selected\" href=\"https://event.ithu.tw/2026050051\" style=\"color: rgb(61, 129, 219); font-family: inherit; font-size: 1rem;\" target=\"_blank\">https://event.ithu.tw/2026050051</a></p></li></ul><p style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">3.\u8ab2\u7a0b\u63d0\u9192\uff1a</p><ul style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><li><p style=\"line-height: 24px;\">\u9808\u81f3\u6821\u5712\u6d3b\u52d5\u5831\u540d\u7cfb\u7d71\u767b\u8a18\u5be6\u9ad4\u8ab2\u7a0b\u6642\u9593\u5f8c\u624d\u53bb\u4e0a\u8ab2\u5594\uff01You must register the physical course time on the Tunghai University Campus Activity Registration System before attending the class!</p></li><li><p style=\"line-height: 24px;\">\u8ab2\u7a0b\u958b\u59cb\u524d\u9700\u8981\u5b8c\u6210\u8ab2\u7a0b\u524d\u5c0e\u6e2c\u9a57Before the course begins, you need to complete the pre-test.</p></li><li><p style=\"line-height: 24px;\">\u53c3\u8207\u8ab2\u7a0b\u6642\u9700\u9032\u884c\u7c3d\u5230\u9000\uff01\u5be6\u9ad4\u8ab2\u7a0b\u7d50\u675f\u5f8c\uff0c\u7531\u8ab2\u7a0b\u7a2e\u5b50\u63d0\u4f9b\u8ab2\u7a0b\u5b78\u7fd2\u55ae\u9023\u7d50\uff0c\u8acb\u52d9\u5fc5\u586b\u5beb\u5594\uff01You must sign in and out when participating in the course! After the physical course ends, the course facilitator will provide a link to the course learning sheet, please be sure to fill it out!</p></li><li><p style=\"line-height: 24px;\">\u8ab2\u7a0b\u6642\u6578\u8a8d\u5217\u8aaa\u660e\uff1a\u7d93\u6771\u6d77\u5927\u5b78\u6d3b\u52d5\u5831\u540d\u7cfb\u7d71\u6210\u529f\u5831\u540d\uff0c\u9700\u5b8c\u6210\u524d\u5c0e\u6e2c\u9a57\u5f8c\u51fa\u5e2d\u8ab2\u7a0b\u7c3d\u5230\u4e14\u5168\u7a0b\u53c3\u8207\u6d3b\u52d5\u5f8c\uff0c\u5b8c\u6210\u6d3b\u52d5\u5b78\u7fd2\u55ae\uff0c\u5373\u8a8d\u5217\u672c\u5b78\u671f\u793e\u6703\u6c38\u7e8c\u8ab2\u7a0b\u6642\u65781\u5c0f\u6642\u3002Course Hour Recognition Instructions: Upon successful registration through the Tunghai University event registration system, completion of the event pre-test, attendance at the course sign-in and full participation in the event, and completion of the event learning sheet, one hour of Social Sustainability course time will be recognized for this semester.</p></li><li><p style=\"line-height: 24px;\">\u672c\u8ab2\u7a0b\u70ba\u300c\u5be6\u9ad4\u4e0a\u8ab2\u300d\uff0c\u4e00\u65e6\u5831\u540d\u6210\u529f\u8acb\u78ba\u5be6\u51fa\u5e2d\u8ab2\u7a0b\u5594\uff01\u672a\u51fa\u5e2d\u8ab2\u7a0b\u4e14\u672a\u5b8c\u6210\u8acb\u5047\u624b\u7e8c\u8005\uff0c\u5012\u6263\u74b0\u5883\u6c38\u7e8c\u5df2\u7372\u5f97\u6642\u65780.5\u5c0f\u6642\u3002Reminder: This course is a \"physical class,\" once you have successfully registered, please make sure to attend the course! If you do not attend the course and do not complete the leave procedure, 0.5 hours will be deducted from the environmental sustainability hours you have already earned.</p></li></ul>","course":{"department":{"name":"\u901a\u8b58\u8ab2\u7a0b:\u6c38\u7e8c\u5be6\u8e10\u9818\u57df"},"grade":{"name":""},"id":165573,"klass":{"name":""},"name":"(1142_3502)\u6c38\u7e8c\u5be6\u8e10\uff1a\u52de\u4f5c\u6559\u80b2\uff08\u4e8c\uff09"},"created_at":"2026-05-17T08:31:26Z","created_by":{"id":0,"name":"[REDACTED_NAME]"},"deleted":0,"end_time":null,"id":373197,"imported_from":null,"imported_track_id":null,"send_email":true,"send_mail_count":1,"send_type":"default","start_time":null,"targets":["a0"],"targets_name":["\u6240\u6709\u4eba"],"title":"\u672c\u5b78\u671f\u793e\u6703\u6c38\u7e8c \u3010\u6771\u5927\u6eaa\u8d70\u8b80\u3011\u5be6\u9ad4\u8ab2\u7a0b  \u7b2c\u5341\u4e09\u90315/18-5/22  \u958b\u653e 5/17(\u65e5)PM5:00~5/18(\u4e00)PM5:00 \u9810\u7d04","updated_at":null,"updated_by":{"id":0,"name":null},"uploads":[]},{"content":"<h1 style=\"font-weight: 700; line-height: 45px; font-size: 26px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"line-height: inherit; color: rgb(227, 55, 55);\">\u672c\u5b78\u671f\u793e\u6703\u6c38\u7e8c \u3010\u6771\u5927\u6eaa\u5287\u672c\u6bba\u3011\u5be6\u9ad4\u8ab2\u7a0b\u00a0 \u7b2c\u5341\u4